// Regression residual diagnostics vs statsmodels 0.13.5: Durbin-Watson,
// ARCH-LM (het_arch), Breusch-Pagan (Koenker and original), White (with a
// collinear dummy product), Breusch-Godfrey (acorr_breusch_godfrey).
// Data: OLS with AR(1) + ARCH(1) + heteroskedastic errors.

